    "id": 579,
    "date": "2018-03-20T12:19:21+00:00",
    "from": null,
    "text": "6 nights here ... plus another nearby.  Last night was very wet and windy.",
    "media": "579.jpg"
  },
  {
    "id": 582,
    "date": "2018-03-20T17:11:01+00:00",
    "from": null,
    "text": "The route - elevations ... many switchbacks.\n\nThis segment I just completed was very challenging - well over 3000 meters climbed.\n\nhttp://www.mapmyride.com/al/vlore-vlore/vlora-saranda-route-61705986",
    "media": "582.jpg"
  },
  {
    "id": 583,
    "date": "2018-03-20T17:20:50+00:00",
    "from": null,
    "text": "Sunshine, exercize, fresh air, peace, quiet, solitude all serve to rejuventate my health.  \n\nThe trick will be to find a place where I can have all of these year 'round.\n\nThe road from Vlorë to Sarandë is incredibly difficult, but lovely.\n\nMany kilometers were spend pushing the bike up hills.\n\nI really enjoyed being away from people, vehicles, dogs, music ... everything.  \n\nAt the beach, there were absolutely no human annoyances; only shepherd and goat herder passing by once per day.\n\nOf course, the air is pure and fresh.  Only problem with that particular location was the absence of trees.\n\nThere was a fresh water spring at the campsite.\n\nThe whole experience led me to consider buying a sailboat and living out at sea.",
    "media": null
  },
  {
    "id": 584,
    "date": "2018-03-20T17:29:38+00:00",
    "from": null,
    "text": "Scenes along the way ...",
